Subject: Wolfenstein 3-D
Lines: 15


Wolfenstein 3-D has a command line switch that enables a debug mode,
that lets TAB and keys change the way the game acts. O nthe command
line, type WOLF3D GOOBERS. When you get to the real game, press Left
shift, left alt, and backspace at the same time. Then, you can use some
TAB combinations. TAB+G enables God mode, where you can't be hurt. TAB+W
warps to another level. TAB+I gives you free items. There are many more,
but I have a bad memory.

